---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <img src={`${base}/logo.png`} alt="東北生徒会連合 ロゴ" class="hero-logo" />
    <span class="badge">TSU - Tohoku Students Union</span>
    <h1 class="title">つながる東北生徒会</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">東北地方の生徒会外務活動を推進し、学校・地域の枠を越えた共創を生み出す学生主体の連合組織</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a href="https://forms.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="primary-btn">参加フォームはこちら →</a>
      <a href={`${base}/#about`} class="secondary-btn">活動概要を見る</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 4.5rem 1.5rem 3.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #f0f9ff 0%, #ffffff 70%);
  }
  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .hero-logo {
    width: 110px;
    height: 110px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.2);
  }
  .badge {
    background: #e0f2fe;
    color: #0369a1;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .title {
    font-size: 2.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #0f172a;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: #475569;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
  }
  .actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .primary-btn {
    background: #0284c7;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .primary-btn:hover {
    background: #0369a1;
  }
  .secondary-btn {
    background: #f1f5f9;
    color: #334155;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .secondary-btn:hover {
    background: #e2e8f0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .title { font-size: 2rem; }
    .subtitle { font-size: 1rem; }
  }
</style>
